  "notes": [
    "FoC debug build, Coruscant quick load, seed 12345, tick 0 at frame 345, 30 logical ticks/s; fog revealed to both players and player AI suspended.",
    "The Rebel level-1 station (Skirmish_Rebel_Star_Base_1) is spawned at (6500,-2075,0) facing +X (bearing 0), an open-space point verified, by directly decoding the map's own placement records, to be more than 2900 units from every map-placed prop -- clear of any 2200-range hardpoint's reach (#516 follow-up). One invulnerable, hold_fire Nebulon-B frigate (owner empire, hostile to the rebel shooter) is spawned 700 units out at bearing 140 degrees (positive to port) from the station's facing (docs/behaviour/space-weapon-fire.md M2 arc table).",
    "Well inside both the laser cannon HP_Rebel_Station_One_LC's arc and the turbolaser HP_Rebel_Station_One_TBL's arc, on the station's broadside; outside the concussion missile HP_Rebel_Station_One_CCM.",
    "No order and no hold_position on the station or the target; an idle unit keeps its heading (A-05). A single target avoids the multi-candidate opportunity-scan tie (R-08/R-09: every candidate ties at priority 1.0 without an authored Targeting_Priority_Set, so the scan stops at the first acceptable one, which need not be the intended bearing) that a shared multi-target scenario would confound.",
    "Record-only: which hardpoints fire, not when; shot timing follows retail random recharge."
  ],
